--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
+Unreleased
+==========
+
+- Rename ``expire()`` parameter ``time`` to ``now`` in ``TTLCache`` and
+  ``TLRUCache``.  Passing ``time`` as a keyword argument is deprecated,
+  but still supported for now.
+
+
 v7.2.8 (2026-10-31)
 ===================
 
